## ⚡ QUICK REFERENCE (USE THIS!)

> **These commands MUST be used during work. Refer here before any memory-related action.**

| When | Command | Example |
|------|---------|---------|
| **Starting work** | `m "Starting..."` | `m "Starting feature X implementation"` |
| **Completing work** | `m "Completed..."` | `m "Completed login feature"` |
| **Recording insight** | `m "message"` | `m "Found bug in auth module"` |
| **Before Claude session** | `mcontext` | Generates `.claude/memory-context.md` |
| **Searching past work** | `ms "query"` | `ms "how did we implement auth"` |
| **View today's work** | `mtoday` | Shows today's timeline |

**CRITICAL:** Use `m` command for timeline entries. Do NOT manually edit timeline files.

